      "annotations": {
        "__dashboardUid__": "av_devices_details",
        "__panelId__": "170",
        "description": "- PDU reports a power-quality ALARM on its own configured thresholds (per-device)\n  Fires when avtools_pdu_query_pq_severity == 2 (a lowAlarm/highAlarm/alarm/overLimit/underLimit, or Sentry3 overLoad, on active power, power factor, out-of-balance, or line current/load).\n  The specific dimension + state are on the *_status_info panels/metrics for the equipment.",
